# Instructions and scripts belong here. Working data does not.
#
# These are a net, not the rule: nothing below should ever be produced by a
# clean clone, and if one reappears it is because an agent wrote runtime state
# into the checkout. Delete it and keep going.

# --- skill runtime state -------------------------------------------------
**/state/*
!**/state/README.md

# --- coordinator and pr-watch bookkeeping --------------------------------
queue.json
prs.json
pending.json
events.jsonl
watch.json
surfaced.json
decisions.json
LEDGER.md
WRITES.md
NOTICES.md

# --- agent memory working data -------------------------------------------
agent-skills/agent-memory/LESSONS.md
agent-skills/agent-memory/lessons/
agent-skills/agent-memory/proposed/*
!agent-skills/agent-memory/proposed/README.md

# --- generated machine jobs ----------------------------------------------
*.plist
*.log

# --- local noise ---------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
